@node documenta-data
@section (documenta data)
This module provides the following interface.

@deffn Procedure get-file-paths directory
Return a list of paths to Scheme files in the given directory.

Scheme files are identified by their «.scm» extension.

DIRECTORY (string) Absolute path to a directory containing a Guile
Scheme library.

RETURN VALUE (list of string) A list where every element represents a
path to a Scheme file.

@end deffn

@deffn Procedure file-path->module-name file-path lib-parent-path
Convert the given Scheme file path into a module name.

@end deffn


@c %end of fragment

